{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BraidsAndKnots.HeckeNormalForm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BraidsAndKnots.HeckeNormalForm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":21,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:nf_basis3_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"nf_basis3_card","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L40-L41","doc":"The NF basis has exactly n! = 6 elements for H₃(q). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:instReprRewriteRule.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"instReprRewriteRule.repr","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:instReprRewriteRule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"instReprRewriteRule","kind":"instance","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:instDecidableEqRewriteRule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"instDecidableEqRewriteRule","kind":"instance","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:RewriteRule.yangBaxter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"RewriteRule.yangBaxter","kind":"ctor","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:RewriteRule.farComm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"RewriteRule.farComm","kind":"ctor","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:RewriteRule.hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"RewriteRule.hecke","kind":"ctor","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:RewriteRule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"RewriteRule","kind":"inductive","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L28-L38","doc":"The three rewriting rules that produce the normal form:\n1. Hecke: σ² → HA·σ + 1\n2. Far commutativity: σᵢσⱼ → σⱼσᵢ for |i−j| ≥ 2\n3. Yang-Baxter: σᵢσⱼσᵢ → σⱼσᵢσⱼ for |i−j| = 1\n\nConfluence follows from the Diamond Lemma (Bergman 1978). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:HeckeNormalForm.coeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"HeckeNormalForm.coeff","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L24-L24","doc":"Coefficient of each basis element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:HeckeNormalForm.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"HeckeNormalForm.mk","kind":"ctor","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L22-L22","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:HeckeNormalForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"HeckeNormalForm","kind":"structure","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L20-L24","doc":"A Hecke normal form is a linear combination of NF basis elements\nwith coefficients in ℤ[q, q⁻¹]. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:instReprNFBasis3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"instReprNFBasis3","kind":"instance","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L18-L18","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:instReprNFBasis3.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"instReprNFBasis3.repr","kind":"def","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L18-L18","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:instDecidableEqNFBasis3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"instDecidableEqNFBasis3","kind":"instance","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L18-L18","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:NFBasis3.trefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"NFBasis3.trefoil","kind":"ctor","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L17-L17","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:NFBasis3.hopfMinus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"NFBasis3.hopfMinus","kind":"ctor","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L16-L16","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:NFBasis3.hopfPlus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"NFBasis3.hopfPlus","kind":"ctor","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L15-L15","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:NFBasis3.gen1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"NFBasis3.gen1","kind":"ctor","line":14,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L14-L14","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:NFBasis3.gen0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"NFBasis3.gen0","kind":"ctor","line":13,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L13-L13","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:NFBasis3.identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"NFBasis3.identity","kind":"ctor","line":12,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L12-L12","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:NFBasis3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"NFBasis3","kind":"inductive","line":9,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/hecke-normal-form.lean#L9-L18","doc":"The 6-element NF basis for H₃(q), indexed by Fin 6.\n{γ, σ₀, σ₁, L₊, L₋, e⁻} biject with S₃. ","signatureChunk":0}]}